# Agreement Amendment Period Calculation

This scope calculates the end date of the replacement period for quantitative restrictions.

```catala
declaration scope AgreementAmendmentScope:
  input startDate content date
  output endDate content date
```

Determining the End of the Replacement Period

```catala
scope AgreementAmendmentScope:
  date round down
  definition endDate equals startDate + 1 year - 1 day
```